# Quick Draw (CR 611.2a, 702.7, 702.4): Bot1's Memnite gets +1/+1 and first strike (2/2) until end of turn, and every creature Bot2 controls -- a
# Youthful Knight (first strike) and a Fencing Ace (double strike) -- loses those keywords until end of turn, getting them back on turn 4. Bot1's
# own Memnite is not an opponent's creature, so it is not stripped (it has neither anyway); the keywords are lost, the 2/1 and 1/1 stay as they are.

